    LLM: 'Focus on creating your first canastra early. Use wild cards wisely to complete sequences. Communicate with partner through discards. Take morto when you have a strong position.\n\nTrack which cards have been played. Coordinate with partner on which sequences to build. Time your go-out carefully - going out early may deny opponents their morto bonus. Manage vulnerability status.\n\nCalculate optimal discard pile takes. Force opponents into difficult positions. Use closed vs open discard pile strategy depending on variant. Advanced card counting to predict opponent hands. Optimize meld layouts for maximum scoring.',
